{"title": "India to Supply Electricity to Nepal Amid Flood Recovery", "summary": "India will supply Nepal with 18 hours of electricity daily to aid its recovery following recent floods. The agreement aims to provide a power backup for Nepal as it deals with the aftermath of the natural disaster. Thousands of people remain missing in Nepal as flood recovery efforts continue.", "summary_points": ["India will provide 18 hours of daily electricity supply to Nepal.", "The electricity supply is intended to support Nepal's recovery efforts.", "Nepal is currently experiencing flood recovery operations.", "Thousands of people are reported missing in Nepal."], "title_hi": "बाढ़ के बाद नेपाल को बिजली की आपूर्ति करेगा भारत", "summary_hi": "हाल की बाढ़ के बाद अपनी रिकवरी में सहायता के लिए भारत नेपाल को प्रतिदिन 18 घंटे बिजली की आपूर्ति करेगा। इस समझौते का उद्देश्य प्राकृतिक आपदा के बाद नेपाल को बिजली बैकअप प्रदान करना है। बाढ़ से उबरने के प्रयासों के बीच नेपाल में हजारों लोग अभी भी लापता हैं।", "summary_points_hi": ["भारत नेपाल को प्रतिदिन 18 घंटे बिजली की आपूर्ति करेगा।", "बिजली आपूर्ति का उद्देश्य नेपाल के रिकवरी प्रयासों का समर्थन करना है।", "नेपाल वर्तमान में बाढ़ से उबरने के अभियानों से गुजर रहा है।", "नेपाल में हजारों लोग लापता बताए जा रहे हैं।"], "framing": {"left": ["The sole outlet reporting on this side highlighted families from Delhi to Norway awaiting news of missing pilgrims, framing the event around personal impact."], "center": ["Multiple outlets focused on the rising death toll and the number of missing persons.", "Several reports detailed international aid efforts, including assistance from China for road reconstruction and a consignment from the French embassy.", "The need for mental health support for affected children, as highlighted by UNICEF, was a prominent point.", "Some coverage discussed scientific findings linking climate and seismic factors to the disaster."], "right": ["Emphasized India's role in providing a power backup to Nepal during its flood rec